// 2189_life_cell_meph.cubalc
// Proof 2189: life_cell meph - soluble periplasmic DD-endopeptidase MepH after MepM.
// Pay min(n,atp,energy) -> heat+n atp-n energy-n; age/pcr/reserve/pmf/sp/thr held.
// Continuum after mepm. Free energy must flow.

REQUIRE VERSION "1.15"
INCLUDE life_cell

ENTITY gate OF Cell 1 40 0
ENTITY poor OF Cell 1 0 0
ENTITY dead OF Cell 0 20 0
ENTITY g0 OF Cell 1 24 0
ENTITY twin OF Cell 1 30 0
ENTITY ceil OF Cell 1 28 0
ENTITY starved OF Cell 1 36 0

